WEBVTT

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.488
Near the end of the program, open the Learners tab and switch to, Posttest.

00:00:09.488 --> 00:00:13.127
From December first, the app opens on Posttest by itself.

00:00:13.927 --> 00:00:18.511
In numeracy, the posttest is Form B, at the same level as the pretest.

00:00:18.511 --> 00:00:22.113
The level is locked, so the two scores can be compared.

00:00:22.113 --> 00:00:27.025
You can give it in the same three ways: on the phone, on paper, or printed.

00:00:27.825 --> 00:00:32.888
In reading, the posttest uses the same tool and the same language as the pretest.

00:00:32.888 --> 00:00:37.639
If the learner has no pretest in the language you choose, the app warns you.

00:00:38.439 --> 00:00:39.701
Open the Report tab.

00:00:39.701 --> 00:00:45.884
It shows the gain in numeracy and in reading, and how many learners scored higher on the posttest.

00:00:46.684 --> 00:00:48.916
Below, the table shows each learner.

00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:54.000
You can see the pretest, the posttest, and the gain, for numeracy and for reading.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.889
It also shows the reading program, the math worksheet reached, and the number of days recorded.

00:01:00.689 --> 00:01:06.492
You can download the report as a C S V file, or print it, or save it as a P D F.

00:01:07.292 --> 00:01:11.878
A gain appears only when a learner has both a pretest and a posttest.

00:01:11.878 --> 00:01:15.800
Gains are in percentage points of items answered correctly.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:20.519
A learner who took reading in English and in Filipino shows both lines.
